_count": 2, "reply_count": 6, "retweet_count": 40}, "text": "Farms depend on synthetic nitrogen fertilizers to increase crop yields, but the production and use of these chemicals generates billions of tonnes of greenhouse-gas emissions every year. Now there's progress on a greener alternative: bioengineered bacteria.", "url": "https://x.com/Nature/status/2120614840146284667"}, {"author_id": "15862891", "created_at": "2026-11-11T20:27:23.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120614385429230059"], "entities": {"urls": [{"description": "Nature - A promising biotechnology company developed a new approach that might treat a rare disease — but its sole employee didn’t do all the work.", "display_url": "go.nature.com/4kaFU63", "end": 245, "expanded_url": "https://go.nature.com/4kaFU63", "images": [{"height": 600, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2120614391154376704/gBAqmRWf?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 1066}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2120614391154376704/gBAqmRWf?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 222, "status": 200, "title": "Anthropic bought a one-person, AI-powered biotech: is this drug discovery’s future?", "unwound_url": "https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-03640-9?utm_source=x&utm_medium=social&utm_campaign=nature&linkId=64380341&error=cookies_not_supported&code=306773e9-1c79-43a7-9c8d-ae2f00ef81a2", "url": "https://t.co/zf6EflESva"}]}, "id": "2120614385429230059", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 25, "impression_count": 18780, "like_count": 74, "quote_count": 5, "reply_count": 9, "retweet_count": 19}, "text": "How many scientists does it take to discover a drug?\n\nThe question came to the fore after news that a biotechnology company armed with an AI assistant and just one full-time human employee had been acquired by Anthropic.\n\nhttps://t.co/zf6EflESva", "url": "https://x.com/Nature/status/2120614385429230059"}], "includes": {"users": [{"id": "28164923", "name": "WSJ Markets", "username": "WSJmarkets"